  {
    "id": 2015008020060,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……！\r\nこっち……！　このお店……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim5": "bag_on",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040150020",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201500802/2015008020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "へえ……\r\n小さくて可愛いお店だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015008020070,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん……\r\n甜花たちも……帰り道、偶然見つけて……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim4": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500802/2015008020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015008020080,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "ここのソフトクリーム、美味しかったから……\r\nそこのスタジオでお仕事した後……たまに、来るんだ……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500802/2015008020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015008020090,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "なーちゃんと、千雪さんと、一緒に……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500802/2015008020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことをしてたのか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015008020100,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "にへへ……\r\n甜花たちだけの、秘密……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500802/2015008020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015008020110,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……あ……\r\nあうう、秘密なのに、言っちゃった……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500802/2015008020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そもそも、記事にしちゃったら、\r\n秘密じゃなくなっちゃうんじゃ……",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015008020120,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "あ、あうう……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500802/2015008020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015008020130,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "後で……\r\nなーちゃんと千雪さんに、言ってもいいか……聞く……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500802/2015008020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな……\r\nお店にも、雑誌に載せていいか確認しないといけないし……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日はひとまず……\r\nソフトクリーム、食べていこうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015008020140,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500802/2015008020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花はどの味が好きなんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015008020150,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花、ミルク味が好き……！\r\n甘くて……優しくて……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500802/2015008020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……\r\nじゃあ、俺もそれを──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015008020160,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "あ、でも……でも……\r\nチョコ味も、美味しくて……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500802/2015008020160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015008020170,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花は、ミルクが好き、だけど……\r\nちょっとだけ、チョコも好きで……大人の味……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500802/2015008020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015008020180,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんには……\r\nえと、その……チョコが、おすすめ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500802/2015008020180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "な、なるほど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃ、じゃあ……\r\n俺は、チョコ味にしようかな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺が食べる前に、一口食べるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015008020190,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "いいの……！？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim4": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500802/2015008020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花たちの秘密に、混ぜてもらったお礼だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015008020200,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "にへへ……\r\nプロデューサーさん、ありがと……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500802/2015008020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015008020210,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "て、甜花が、買ってくるね……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
